      "rationale": "引文[78,202)陈述 intrinsics 是 'a set of C and C++ functions defined in arm_neon.h'；[289,386)陈述 'the functions themselves contain short assembly kernels which are inlined into the calling code.'（结合[0,78) 'precise implementation is known to a compiler'，内联由编译器完成）；[401,475)陈述 'register allocation and pipeline optimization are handled by the compiler'。claim 三要素（arm_neon.h 定义的 C/C++ 函数、内联短汇编内核、寄存器分配与流水线优化）均被直接覆盖，判 supported。targets.provenance 为空对象且引文内无转载声明，独立性无法举证，记 independence_unknown。偏移为该 quote 文本的 Unicode 码点半开区间。",
